--------------------- CableDyn Input File ------------------------------------
Lozon Gulf of Mexico 80 m full installed power cable driven by prescribed floater heave
-- Geometry and properties match lozon_gomex80_power_cable.dat. The motion file contains
-- absolute fairlead position, velocity, and acceleration for a 3 m, 12 s harmonic heave.
-- A C2 quintic ramp over the first 12 s starts the cable from rest without a velocity impulse.
