--------------------- SECTIONS ----------------------------------------------
-- 64 section-aligned elements: with a 0.00625 s step, fairlead tension (std and peak) and peak
-- curvature on this mesh are within 0.5 % of a 1024-element solution, and the element-mean
-- tensile audit passes. The shipped 0.05 s step keeps the run short and prints the step-size note
-- discussed in the motion tutorial: a nodal tangent turns about 0.29 deg in one step, where mean
-- tension errors reach about 1 % above 0.25 deg per step; a smaller time step resolves it.
